  "decision_date": "24/11/2011",
  "description": "Extension of time period to implement planning permission 00248/329/P12 dated 24/04/2008 for the demolition of existing building- Construction of part 2, part 3 and part 4 storey building with basement to create one A1 shop unit on ground floor and basement, 2 x B1 (Commercial) units on ground floor and basement, 4 x 2 bed flats and 1 x 1 bed flat above.",
  "site_name": "329",
  "last_updated_by": "Northgate M3",
  "decision_target_date": "11/02/2011",
  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "postcode": "W4 4HS",
  "street_name": "Chiswick High Road",
  "bo_system": "Northgate M3",
  "development_type": "Minor all other minor developments",
  "lapsed_date": "23/11/2014",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - No development shall take place until samples of the materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the hereby permitted have been submitted to and approved in writing by the local planning authority.  Development shall be carried out in accordance with the approved details",
    "Condition : 3 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith (06153/100, 06153/101, 06153/102, 06153/103, 06153/104, 06153/105, 06153/201 Rev E, 06153/202 Rev E, 06153/203 Rev E, 06153/205 Rev E, 06153/206 Rev E, 06153/207 Rev D, 06153/208 Rev D, 06153/209 Rev D, 06153/211 Rev A, 06153/212 Rev B, 06153/213 Rev A, 06153/214 received 7th November 2007) and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 4 - The proposed timber screen walls on the balconies of Units 1 and 3 shall be installed and maintained at a minimum of 2.1 metres high and a maximum of 2.2 metres high.",
    "Condition : 5 - The development shall include the use of noise mitigation measures including (but not limited to) double-glazing/secondary glazing, and acoustically rated trickle ventilators to ensure that noise levels from externalsources does not exceed 35dB(A) within the residential units. Details of proposed noise mitigation measures to achieve this level shall be forwarded to the local planning authority to be approved in writing prior to the occupation of the residential units.",
    "Condition : 6 - One of the proposed double entrance doors to the A1 unit shall provide a clear opening width of at least 900mm, and shall be identified as being suitable for disabled and mobility impaired access.",
    "Condition : 7 - The access doorways to the building shall have a minimum clear width of 900mm, a level surface or ramp between the pavement and the floor and a door handle of not more than 1m above ground level.",
    "Condition : 8 - No development shall take place until details have been submitted to and approved in writing by the local planning Authority for a scheme of reducing carbon emissions from the total energy needs (heat, cooling and power) of the development by at least 20% by onsite generation of renewable energy. The details shall be carried out as approved.",
    "Condition : 9 - No development shall take place until details have been submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority with respect to the design and materials of the proposed shop fronts of all the ground floor units of thedevelopment. The details shall be carried out as approved.",
    "Condition : 10 - No development shall take place until details have been submitted and approved by the Local Planning Authority with respect to the arrangements for refuse and recycling storage areas. The details shall be carried out as approved."
  ],
